{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2022-08-17 11:00:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP TO PARTICIPATE IN THE KBW INSURANCE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'RADNOR, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP (NYSE:LNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT RANDY J. FREITAG, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP, WILL PRESENT AT THE KBW INSURANCE CONFERENCE ON THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 8, 2022 AT APPROXIMATELY 11:20 A.M. EASTERN TIME. MR. FREITAG WILL PARTICIPATE IN A QUESTION-AND-ANSWER SESSION COVERING A VARIETY OF INDUSTRY AND COMPANY-SPECIFIC TOPICS. THE LIVE PRESENTATION WILL BE AVAILABLE AT WWW.LFG.COM/WEBCAST. PLEASE GO'}